  "An arXiv study (Sep 2025) found 83.8% of agent-assisted PRs eventually merged but only 54.9% merged unmodified.": 1,
  "Faros AI (Jun 2025) found high-AI teams merged 98% more PRs but PR review time rose 91% and PR size climbed 154%, with no measurable org-level DORA gain.": 1,
  "Unblocked defines cost per merged PR as fully-loaded AI cost (token spend, tool and seat spend, review time cost, rework cost) divided by PRs that merge and survive a churn window, e.g. two weeks without being reverted or substantially rewritten.": 1,
  "Unblocked's controlled test found that better context cut tokens 42%, ran 27% faster, and used 64% fewer tool calls on the same prompt and model.": 1,
  "Unblocked's illustrative worked example (not a customer result) gives a cost per merged PR of $500 with low context and $261 with high context, counting only PRs that survived the churn window.": 1
